            <div xml:id="m-3deefda1-f7ed-45f3-801b-6a3b7464eeca">
              <lg xml:id="m-d399eeb0-18f3-4161-a4cc-16d5ea2ccb06">
                <l xml:id="m-c75ad422-8dd7-4f68-b7d7-d8a67939b5cc" facs="#m-f00ac96b-19ec-4bb6-9da7-d2014297fcf2" label="ambiguous">Saturday in Easter Week.</l><l xml:id="m-167c81ed-3350-47d7-827d-3668562b6ac6" facs="#m-32da3d92-5ed9-470b-ad7f-ded607d7894d" label="ambiguous">807</l><l xml:id="m-0b3a4d1a-5d6a-478b-89da-9c74c7a28e16" facs="#m-b7549e73-1afb-4e21-a2e1-331feab531df" label="ambiguous">ia,</l><l xml:id="m-e5abd71a-379a-40fb-ab20-14c89414f1e0" facs="#m-517c9ec8-f759-46c4-ad52-b6254e4c02c7" label="ambiguous">alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-8628f511-3eba-4d3e-bac7-9c8826be86dc" facs="#m-8f854fb4-f7e0-49c5-bf36-3e2d874b4624" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-c9d023c2-80e7-4a99-8bca-2f106d2e3c7e" facs="#m-53f3560c-651a-4357-a389-9c3e04ac9729" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-016b6eaa-cdd1-466d-8612-0881626c68b4" facs="#m-19fc1a53-564f-4e31-87f0-be537aa1ff7d" label="lyrics-like">VOncéde, quaésumus Dómine, nostrae reparatiónis operátio, per¬</l><l xml:id="m-51fd1ac0-71b4-4345-9a5f-e9cff84d00f3" facs="#m-1e7b7d78-2dbb-4a63-875b-7d51144d27c4" label="lyrics-like">L semper nos per haec mystéria! pétuae nobis fiat causa laetítiae.</l><l xml:id="m-d52d950e-d10a-4453-a948-b9079a7702da" facs="#m-f73054d5-1f2e-4e4a-bea4-b9ab6d621803" label="lyrics-like">paschália gratulári: ut contínua !Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-2e943fad-145f-4907-9122-7653d2a6af30" facs="#m-52245395-e70f-417a-ac31-ed49948b9cbb" label="text-like">2. for the Church or for the Pope, p. 322.</l><l xml:id="m-945fb052-de6f-47e6-af5d-f4adc86da943" facs="#m-0da2e69b-3f5d-4518-b6e2-fb3708482d07" label="text-like">Preface. Easter Sunday, p. 8.</l><l xml:id="m-5d4002c8-14f9-4669-9c51-350e39e69d70" facs="#m-ed19aad3-389f-49c7-b332-f424f7469c61" label="ambiguous">Comm.</l><l xml:id="m-8e395fb8-24d0-4d17-b118-a9b52107cff8" facs="#m-6048ce3d-ac6e-4406-a676-b9a4ad2277e3" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-178b7596-35de-4afc-a72b-82cfb7753c9b" facs="#m-289584af-25a5-4093-b509-b6834bdb6ca2" label="lyrics-like">-mnes* qui in Chrí-sto bapti-zá-ti é¬</l><l xml:id="m-4326286b-5c47-474f-8823-12f0008e63c1" facs="#m-d9a46cd4-90d2-466c-9806-844e8c9a9026" label="lyrics-like">stis, Chrí- stum indu- I-stis, al-le-lú¬ ia.</l><l xml:id="m-e3d9ae13-6c80-40e5-b9b0-c185acd62e2e" facs="#m-7f32cd88-b721-40cd-a342-878bc76de8af" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-b3a1df46-e710-4f15-8be2-23bc658b07e1" facs="#m-96879d87-987f-4227-9c70-21f0bafa996d" label="lyrics-like">»Edemptiónis nostrae mánere fides semper vera proficiat. Per</l><l xml:id="m-aebca210-e10a-4ac0-812c-3a9db557d6cf" facs="#m-e8d10786-c6c2-43af-bfa2-fb35600a3090" label="lyrics-like">Lt vegetáti, quaésumus Dómine: Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-3c7b7b1e-d52f-45cd-a769-b7b806eefef9" facs="#m-ff3375c3-bb34-4a8f-97a2-ef7a8503b8e5" label="lyrics-like">ut hoc perpétuae salútis auxilio,</l><l xml:id="m-f298a970-5cf6-41cd-b98a-ff30fec5b45f" facs="#m-272a2154-eb53-4da9-a693-e965adb164fb" label="text-like">2. for the Church or for the Pope, p. 323.</l><l xml:id="m-82fa0271-5ba2-4d9d-98c3-5d5496530097" facs="#m-6d0b11c2-bb06-48cd-a7f3-9c68f4bfb584" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-27dad2a2-b323-4be4-882b-65ddc84c3c39" facs="#m-acc83ee7-7ff5-4fb8-a200-4edf77aabd0e" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-311f1d5b-9ed3-46f4-a59b-b95c32d8ed95" facs="#m-632d2daf-5457-40f0-a4e9-57d4bd5e9ca8" label="text-like">Antiphons and Psalms of the Saturday, Paschal Time, p. 307.</l><l xml:id="m-28ce4d96-70b3-423b-a431-4c25db9fb8e2" facs="#m-59e4333f-f4c6-4fc8-bba7-174068bbb0f3" label="lyrics-like">Chapter. Caríssimi : Omne quod. p. 812. Hymn. Ad régias Agni</l><l xml:id="m-03228422-4483-4b38-8dd6-c2e90d155d8d" facs="#m-e3be261f-13e6-4bdf-8dad-a39ef9e1c5c6" label="lyrics-like">dápes. p. 812 or p. 814. V. Mane nobíscum. p. 815.</l><l xml:id="m-cec9a1a1-acfa-41a2-bb0e-b0e0b8a699b7" facs="#m-315cf851-ae8f-403e-ae1f-62d5286872cc" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-105e564e-8ebc-4ef5-931b-57f82c3876c1" facs="#m-fd0fc985-13c4-4513-8459-fd4bbe3f311b" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.D</l><l xml:id="m-30893719-03be-4051-856f-c44c8f5ca771" facs="#m-5dc72bea-1156-4038-9404-f66fe678c3d0" label="lyrics-like">UM ésset se-ro“ dí-e il-la úna sab-ba-tó¬</l><l xml:id="m-e695dfbe-caa2-4ce2-b75c-b0f52dabd5c3" facs="#m-67f09485-bbf1-431f-92c7-6bc59e62bb06" label="lyrics-like">rum, et fó-res éssent cláusae, ubi é-rant discspu-li con¬</l><l xml:id="m-95bc819e-27d9-4033-87ef-fb65b4e6b170" facs="#m-75c8f97f-7bd3-4560-9bdf-026e16715895" label="lyrics-like">gre-gá- ti, sté-tit Jésus in médi-o,</l><l xml:id="m-44ffd4b5-f1fe-477c-9341-1d1dd40b99c5" facs="#m-ad1f4af6-e159-4d97-9ae5-fd0a1df70f1f" label="lyrics-like">et díxit é-is: Pax</l><l xml:id="m-18865176-e19e-4dae-9a91-5c7b09a2c938" facs="#m-3b9bcadc-d5bf-4b6c-9092-a47911e3fc2b" label="ambiguous">Nesol-2</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
